<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-04-27T18:47:20.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "use_links": "true",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "Can you trust your eyes and ears today?\n\n\nWelcome to the age of **deepfakes**. A deepfake is a fake video or voice clip made by AI. It makes a real person look or sound like they are saying things they never did. \n\nLearn how deepfakes work and how to use your judgment to spot them.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/0bd6cd5cdaf896d4369056620649abe9-title.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-76cfc3a9-f66a-4395-aa1f-c847b4c2ff9c",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Voice Cloning",
            "x": 18,
            "y": 17,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc4442bb-1ae9-4ee1-a87d-43df7ed1e5ba",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Urgency",
            "x": 36,
            "y": 55,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e7abd69c-9e43-4cb7-a607-3612f34a9d27",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Protection",
            "x": 81,
            "y": 68,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b73c1718-f5c9-45ce-ba98-07f63a5df2a3",
            "width": 12
          }
        ],
        "typing": true
      },
      {
        "text": "AI doesn't just record you. It studies your voice patterns. It learns how you breathe, your accent, and how you show feelings. By looking at a small audio clip, it builds a digital map of your voice",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/172b61b9292d967de14e04b466b84121-one.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc4442bb-1ae9-4ee1-a87d-43df7ed1e5ba",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-76cfc3a9-f66a-4395-aa1f-c847b4c2ff9c",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "3 Second Rule",
            "x": 70,
            "y": 65,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b82b8d90-07cd-4bdb-b2d9-88a92552312f",
            "width": 10
          },
          {
            "text": "How to tell?",
            "x": 45,
            "y": 26,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-88dd4601-08d5-49ab-ae9e-5921634e512b",
            "width": 10
          },
          {
            "text": "Fake emotion",
            "x": 80,
            "y": 23,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-41b1747e-c624-4681-bb54-3d915970eed0",
            "width": 10
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-bottom-left",
        "typing": false
      },
      {
        "text": "Scammers use AI to create a stressful moment. They make you feel you must act fast to help a friend in trouble. They use public info to make the talk feel private. They hope you will not stop to ask questions.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/53b3694fdff456c93e603e6a24ab5e3f-two.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e7abd69c-9e43-4cb7-a607-3612f34a9d27",
        "typing": false,
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-76cfc3a9-f66a-4395-aa1f-c847b4c2ff9c",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Call Back",
            "x": 62,
            "y": 82,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e1002bf4-3146-44bf-9738-75f0c24a064a",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Fake ID Trick",
            "x": 86,
            "y": 59,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-89789c9a-3ce2-4e2e-867a-60ac3f465be5",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Hurry Up Trap",
            "x": 24,
            "y": 72,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-6ac5926e-78bc-4aeb-9792-0cef601cc776",
            "width": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "To stay safe, use your brain. Make rules to check if a person is real or an AI copy.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/28e74e93d0ce1980fa6a568cef636c03-three.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b73c1718-f5c9-45ce-ba98-07f63a5df2a3",
        "typing": false,
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-76cfc3a9-f66a-4395-aa1f-c847b4c2ff9c",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Family Safe Words",
            "x": 81,
            "y": 80,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc97a9dd-9069-4312-94b4-7552217a4a4b",
            "width": 10
          },
          {
            "text": "Question",
            "x": 39,
            "y": 30,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-1cc06862-61be-44af-a5c8-2d441c12b441",
            "width": 11
          },
          {
            "text": "Offline Checks",
            "x": 18,
            "y": 78,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-0d7f9da5-5bcb-4178-ae31-a1f5a15ed395",
            "width": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "People used to think you needed hours of recording to copy a voice. Now, AI only needs 3 seconds of audio to make a realistic clone. It can take this from a public video, like a TikTok or a gaming stream.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/044ebc9091c926afd9518a587091b6c9-one-one.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b82b8d90-07cd-4bdb-b2d9-88a92552312f",
        "typing": false,
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc4442bb-1ae9-4ee1-a87d-43df7ed1e5ba",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Look for red flags like weird breathing or robotic sounds. These signs show a pattern that is not human.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/78b7de7316839247b590a2fb0c9fe2ab-one-two.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-88dd4601-08d5-49ab-ae9e-5921634e512b",
        "typing": false,
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc4442bb-1ae9-4ee1-a87d-43df7ed1e5ba",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "AI can add sensitive traits like panic or crying to a cloned voice to stop you from thinking clearly.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5a904398b4f19c68180759c919ab1500-one-three.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-41b1747e-c624-4681-bb54-3d915970eed0",
        "typing": false,
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc4442bb-1ae9-4ee1-a87d-43df7ed1e5ba",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Hanging up and calling the person back on a different app is a great way to stay safe.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c1f943d489736ed39f1cd25b59be7acd-two-three.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e1002bf4-3146-44bf-9738-75f0c24a064a",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e7abd69c-9e43-4cb7-a607-3612f34a9d27",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "typing": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Scammers use tools to change the caller ID on your phone. They make it show a name you trust, like a parent or a friend.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/874cfd425e7b258ee65ea43df0c5a206-two-one.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-89789c9a-3ce2-4e2e-867a-60ac3f465be5",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e7abd69c-9e43-4cb7-a607-3612f34a9d27",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "typing": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "AI calls use fake emergencies to trick you. They want you to share your password or location fast.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/666a5ec0cdb1e8641566369f5239e7ec-two-two.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-6ac5926e-78bc-4aeb-9792-0cef601cc776",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-e7abd69c-9e43-4cb7-a607-3612f34a9d27",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "typing": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Families can pick a secret word. If a caller does not know it, they are likely a deepfake.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/01ae5d20f03224d9d528db66a1a4fc6b-three-one.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-fc97a9dd-9069-4312-94b4-7552217a4a4b",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 7,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b73c1718-f5c9-45ce-ba98-07f63a5df2a3",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "typing": false,
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Always double-check who you are talking to. It is a smart way to live with AI.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/258f7e076fa3a7a582b07cad650a7f89-three-three.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-1cc06862-61be-44af-a5c8-2d441c12b441",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b73c1718-f5c9-45ce-ba98-07f63a5df2a3",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "typing": false,
        "showContinueButton": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Ask a question about something that happened offline, like what you ate for breakfast. An AI would not know the answer.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/34ca3b7edb62629ca60bd5ba62dba17c-three-two.jpg",
        "key": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-0d7f9da5-5bcb-4178-ae31-a1f5a15ed395",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "< **BACK**",
            "x": 6,
            "y": 8,
            "targetKey": "thinking_critically_lesson8_level1a_2026-b73c1718-f5c9-45ce-ba98-07f63a5df2a3",
            "width": 11
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "typing": false,
        "showContinueButton": true
      }
    ],
    "display_name": "Real or AI?",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Explore the effects of artificial media produced by AI",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/7cbcd82871f25ba99b76c5fe21be3bbe-one.jpg"
  },
